```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Stratified Arithmetic CFG
        E["E (Expression: Low Precedence)"]
        T["T (Term: High Precedence)"]
        F["F (Factor: Atomic Delimiters)"]

        E -->|"+" or "-"| E1["E + T | E - T"]
        E -->|Passthrough| T
        T -->|"*" or "/"| T1["T * F | T / F"]
        T -->|Passthrough| F
        F -->|"Parenthesized"| F1["( E )"]
        F -->|"Identifier"| F2["id"]
        F -->|"Number"| F3["num"]
    end
```
